तस्मात्सर्वेषु कालेषु योगयुक्तो भवार्जुन ॥ २७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2527,\"bb\":2236,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/8/27/b2236/\",\"body_value\":\"naite sṛtī pārtha jānan
